    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Four-Way League】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description:</><Assistant_System>Four-Way League</> is a large-scale battlefield gameplay between Clubs. Each match features <Assistant_Red>4 Clubs</> competing in the same arena, with each Club fielding up to <Assistant_Red>60 official members</>, for a total of <Assistant_Red>240 players</> per match; a single Club can have at most <Assistant_Red>16 people</> of the same Pathway on the field. Each match lasts <Assistant_Red>23 minutes</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Tournament Rules:</>Each round consists of two matches. Before the first match of each round, the 1st/2nd, 3rd/4th, 5th/6th, and 7th/8th place teams of the group enter different match groups and are randomly assigned while satisfying this rule. The top 2 of each group in the first match enter the Winner's Bracket, and the bottom 2 enter the Loser's Bracket; the second match consists of Winner's Bracket and Loser's Bracket duels to determine the 1st to 8th place for the round.\n<Assistant_Title2>Victory Rules:</>The Club that reaches <Assistant_Red>3000 points</> first immediately secures victory; if no one reaches 3000 points when the match ends, the ranking is based on current points. If points are equal, compare <Assistant_Property1>Total Kills</>, then <Assistant_Property1>Total Club Beyonder Rating</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>In-Match Points:</>The only source of in-match points is Guardian ownership settlement. The first to occupy a Guardian gains <Assistant_Red>50 points</>; every <Assistant_Red>5 seconds</> during small settlements, each occupied Guardian provides <Assistant_Red>1 point</>; every <Assistant_Red>30 seconds</> during large settlements, each occupied Guardian provides <Assistant_Red>18 points</>. At the <Assistant_Red>4th, 8th, 12th, 16th, and 20th minutes</> of the match, high-multiplier Guardian ownership settlements will randomly refresh, providing <Assistant_Red>72 or 108 points</> per occupied Guardian.\n<Assistant_Title2>Strategic Server Screening Points:</>During the first two rounds of the league in the <Assistant_Property1>Strategic Server Screening Phase</>, the Strategic Server Screening Point rules will be enabled. 1st to 4th place in a single match receive <Assistant_Red>30, 15, 10, 5 points</> respectively; 1st to 4th place in the final of the first round receive <Assistant_Red>60, 50, 45, 40 points</>, and 5th to 8th place receive <Assistant_Red>10 points</> each; 1st to 4th place in the final of the second round receive <Assistant_Red>200, 100, 70, 50 points</>, and 5th to 8th place receive <Assistant_Red>15 points</> each. After the first two rounds of the league in the Strategic Server Screening Phase, the top 4 Clubs in total Strategic Server Screening points in this division will advance to the <Assistant_Property1>Four-Way League Apocalypse Group</> and gain the qualification to <Assistant_Property1>participate in the Strategic Server</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Tie-breaking:</>Strategic Server Screening rankings are primarily ordered by <Assistant_Property1>Total Strategic Server Screening Points</> from high to low. If total points are equal: after the first or second round of the league, sort by the Club's <Assistant_Property1>Final Ranking</> in this round, with the higher rank taking priority; after the first match of each round of the Four-Way League, the final ranking for this round has not yet been determined, so tied Clubs are not distinguished by rank, and the current display order does not represent the final ranking of this round.\n<Assistant_Title2>Guardian Contention:</>There are <Assistant_Red>5 Guardians</> on the battlefield. The Club that lands the final blow on a Guardian gains control of it; after ownership, the Guardian will immediately respawn and belong to that side. Guardians cannot be healed, but will slowly recover health automatically when there are no enemies nearby.\n<Assistant_Title2>Resources and Command:</>Defeating enemy players or occupying Guardians grants resource points and automatically accumulates Morale Level. The President, Vice-President, and Councilors can consume resource points to release Command Skills.\n<Assistant_Title2>Command Skills:</><Assistant_Property1>Declaration of Defeating the Enemy</> consumes 1000 resource points, increasing all members' Pathway Suppression by 15% for 20 seconds, cooldown 180 seconds; <Assistant_Property1>Forced March</> consumes 600 resource points, increasing all members' movement speed by 60% for 10 seconds, cooldown 120 seconds; <Assistant_Property1>Zeroing Edict</> consumes 1500 resource points, clearing the current resurrection wait for all members and covering members who fall in battle within the following 5 seconds, cooldown 240 seconds; <Assistant_Property1>Summon Teleport</> consumes 2400 resource points, summoning all members to the designated assembly point, cooldown 240 seconds; <Assistant_Property1>Sanctuary Protection</> consumes 1000 resource points, restoring 50% of the maximum health of all your side's Guardians, cooldown 180 seconds.\n<Assistant_Title2>Participation Method:</>{JumpToUI:[前往四方联赛]|1250063}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Four-Way League】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description:</><Assistant_System>Four-Way League</> is a large-scale battlefield gameplay between Clubs. Each match features <Assistant_Red>4 Clubs</> competing in the same arena, with each Club fielding up to <Assistant_Red>60 official members</>, for a total of <Assistant_Red>240 players</> per match; a single Club can have at most <Assistant_Red>16 people</> of the same Pathway on the field. Each match lasts <Assistant_Red>23 minutes</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Tournament Rules:</>Each round consists of two matches. Before the first match of each round, the 1st/2nd, 3rd/4th, 5th/6th, and 7th/8th place teams of the group enter different match groups and are randomly assigned while satisfying this rule. The top 2 of each group in the first match enter the Winner's Bracket, and the bottom 2 enter the Loser's Bracket; the second match consists of Winner's Bracket and Loser's Bracket duels to determine the 1st to 8th place for the round.\n<Assistant_Title2>Victory Rules:</>The Club that reaches <Assistant_Red>3000 points</> first immediately secures victory; if no one reaches 3000 points when the match ends, the ranking is based on current points. If points are equal, compare <Assistant_Property1>Total Kills</>, then <Assistant_Property1>Total Club Beyonder Rating</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>In-Match Points:</>The only source of in-match points is Guardian ownership settlement. The first to occupy a Guardian gains <Assistant_Red>50 points</>; every <Assistant_Red>5 seconds</> during small settlements, each occupied Guardian provides <Assistant_Red>1 point</>; every <Assistant_Red>30 seconds</> during large settlements, each occupied Guardian provides <Assistant_Red>18 points</>. At the <Assistant_Red>4th, 8th, 12th, 16th, and 20th minutes</> of the match, high-multiplier Guardian ownership settlements will randomly refresh, providing <Assistant_Red>72 or 108 points</> per occupied Guardian.\n<Assistant_Title2>Strategic Server Screening Points:</>During the first two rounds of the league in the <Assistant_Property1>Strategic Server Screening Phase</>, the Strategic Server Screening Point rules will be enabled. 1st to 4th place in a single match receive <Assistant_Red>30, 15, 10, 5 points</> respectively; 1st to 4th place in the final of the first round receive <Assistant_Red>60, 50, 45, 40 points</>, and 5th to 8th place receive <Assistant_Red>10 points</> each; 1st to 4th place in the final of the second round receive <Assistant_Red>200, 100, 70, 50 points</>, and 5th to 8th place receive <Assistant_Red>15 points</> each. After the first two rounds of the league in the Strategic Server Screening Phase, the top 4 Clubs in total Strategic Server Screening points in this division will advance to the <Assistant_Property1>Four-Way League Apocalypse Group</> and gain the qualification to <Assistant_Property1>participate in the Strategic Server</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Tie-breaking:</>Strategic Server Screening rankings are primarily ordered by <Assistant_Property1>Total Strategic Server Screening Points</> from high to low. If total points are equal: after the first or second round of the league, sort by the Club's <Assistant_Property1>Final Ranking</> in this round, with the higher rank taking priority; after the first match of each round of the Four-Way League, the final ranking for this round has not yet been determined, so tied Clubs are not distinguished by rank, and the current display order does not represent the final ranking of this round.\n<Assistant_Title2>Guardian Contention:</>There are <Assistant_Red>5 Guardians</> on the battlefield. The Club that lands the final blow on a Guardian gains control of it; after ownership, the Guardian will immediately respawn and belong to that side. Guardians cannot be healed, but will slowly recover health automatically when there are no enemies nearby.\n<Assistant_Title2>Resources and Command:</>Defeating enemy players or occupying Guardians grants resource points and automatically accumulates Morale Level. The President, Vice-President, and Councilors can consume resource points to release Command Skills.\n<Assistant_Title2>Command Skills:</><Assistant_Property1>Declaration of Defeating the Enemy</> consumes 1000 resource points, increasing all members' Pathway Suppression by 15% for 20 seconds, cooldown 180 seconds; <Assistant_Property1>Forced March</> consumes 600 resource points, increasing all members' movement speed by 60% for 10 seconds, cooldown 120 seconds; <Assistant_Property1>Zeroing Edict</> consumes 1500 resource points, clearing the current resurrection wait for all members and covering members who fall in battle within the following 5 seconds, cooldown 240 seconds; <Assistant_Property1>Summon Teleport</> consumes 2400 resource points, summoning all members to the designated assembly point, cooldown 240 seconds; <Assistant_Property1>Sanctuary Protection</> consumes 1000 resource points, restoring 50% of the maximum health of all your side's Guardians, cooldown 180 seconds.\n<Assistant_Title2>Participation Method:</>{JumpToUI:[Go to Four-Way League]|1250063}",
