    ["<DecH>工艺：</>雾色锦缎・晨露缀饰・清雅礼服\n清晨雾霭之中，有精灵留下踪迹。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Mist Colored Brocade - Morning Dew Ornament - Elegant Gown \n In the morning mist, spirits have left their traces.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86052010\" color=\"#f4a067\">漫游</>状态额外附加<HighLight>隐身</>效果，释放技能、受到攻击或使用物品会解除<HighLight>隐身</>效果。"] = "The <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86052010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Roaming</> state additionally applies an <HighLight>Invisibility</> effect. Releasing a skill, taking damage, or using an item will remove the <HighLight>Invisibility</> effect.",
    ["<InvHighlight>序言</>\n迷雾中的巨人：重估罗塞尔的历史地位\n\n<InvHighlight>第一章</>\n古斯塔夫家族：没落贵族复兴序曲\n\n<InvHighlight>第二章</>\n蒸汽时代浪潮：工业革命的推动者\n\n<InvHighlight>第三章</>\n战争与秩序：世界格局的奠基者\n\n<InvHighlight>第四章</>\n伟大的航道：南北大陆航道开拓者"] = "<InvHighlight>Preface</>\nThe Giant in the Mist: Reevaluating Roselle's Historical Status\n\n<InvHighlight>Chapter 1</>\nThe Gustav Family: Prelude to the Revival of a Fallen Aristocracy\n\n<InvHighlight>Chapter 2</>\nThe Wave of the Steam Age: The Driving Force of the Industrial Revolution\n\n<InvHighlight>Chapter 3</>\nWar and Order: The Founders of the World Order\n\n<InvHighlight>Chapter 4</>\nThe Great Sea Route: Pioneers of the North-South Continental Routes",
    ["<P_Heart>（呼喊）</> 阿尔伯特！阿尔伯特？奇怪，他刚刚还在这里。"] = "<P_Heart> (Calling out) </> Albert! Albert? Strange, he was just here a moment ago.",
    ["<P_Heart>（气氛变得好凝重……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The atmosphere has become so heavy...) </>",
